#: model:digest.tip,name:project_enterprise_hr_todo.digest_tip_project_todo_1
msgid "Tip: Create to-dos by email"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບ: ສ້າງສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຜ່ານອີເມວ"

#. module: project_enterprise_hr_todo
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_enterprise_hr_todo.field_project_task__display_name
msgid ""
"Use these keywords in the title to set new tasks:\n"
"\n"
"        30h Allocate 30 hours to the task\n"
"        #tags Set tags on the task\n"
"        @user Assign the task to a user\n"
"        ! Set the task a medium priority\n"
"        !! Set the task a high priority\n"
"        !!! Set the task a urgent priority\n"
"\n"
"        Make sure to use the right format and order e.g. Improve the "
"configuration screen 5h #feature #v16 @Mitchell !"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຫົວຂໍ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງໜ້າວຽກໃໝ່:\n"
"\n"
"        30h ກຳນົດເວລາ 30 ຊົ່ວໂມງໃຫ້ໜ້າວຽກ\n"
"        #tags ໃສ່ແທັກໃຫ້ໜ້າວຽກ\n"
"        @user ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ງານ\n"
"        ! ຕັ້ງບຸລິມະສິດໜ້າວຽກເປັນປານກາງ\n"
"        !! ຕັ້ງບຸລິມະສິດໜ້າວຽກເປັນສູງ\n"
"        !!! ຕັ້ງບຸລິມະສິດໜ້າວຽກເປັນຮີບດ່ວນ\n"
"\n"
"        ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຊັ່ນ: ປັບປຸງໜ້າຈໍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ 5h "
"#feature #v16 @Mitchell !"

#. module: project_enterprise_hr_todo
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:project_enterprise_hr_todo.onboarding_todo_email_alias_info
msgid ""
"to create a to-do for yourself.\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            Want to include others? Add their email "
"addresses in the <strong>To</strong> field — they'll be added as assignees."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດສຳລັບຕົວທ່ານເອງ.\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີຄົນອື່ນນຳບໍ່? ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຂອງພວກເຂົາໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ "
"<strong>To</strong> — ພວກເຂົາຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າເປັນຜູ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບ."

